  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>這是《影子中的人》的搞笑重製版。</strong></span></h1>\n<p><br><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">英文：</span>T<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">his mod is purely designed for laughs, adding all sorts of funny images and sounds. It doesn't change the fact that the screamers are still screamers; besides making players laugh, they can still scare them. Imagine walking through a forest when suddenly a man jumps out at you with a funny sound, what would you think? In this new update, the mod is fully adapted to the latest version of TMFTS. The mod tries to bring something new to the horror genre</span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">. The mod doesn't want to offend anyone.</span><br><br><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">俄文：<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">本模組是對《影子中的人》原版外殼的完全搞笑重製，融入了梗圖、荒謬與獵奇元素。超級好笑且極度瘋狂的模組，能讓你捧腹大笑，甚至可能嚇到你。模組內的所有音效、驚嚇畫面、貼圖、文字等均已替換。本模組旨在娛樂，並無意冒犯他人；模組內不含封鎖詞彙，完全符合 Twitch 友善規範，但仍可能包含一些敏感字眼。<br><br><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><strong>....拒絕搖臀舞....</strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>!!!請務必下載 GECKOLIB！！！<br>!!!請務必下載 GECKOLIB！！！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span><span><iframe style=\"width:503px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_xegWBvU0-k\" width=\"503\" height=\"294\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;看看這些超讚的影片！！！<br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;看看這些超讚的影片！！！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span><span><iframe style=\"width:490px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_eTPzLnBOIQ\" width=\"490\" height=\"287\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>支援作者：</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.donationalerts.com%252fr%252fxw0ya\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xw0ya - DonationAlerts</a><br></strong><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://boosty.to/handhprod_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Xw0ya - Boosty</strong></a></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>YouTube 作者頻道：</strong></span><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Xw0yaaa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Xw0ya YouTube 頻道</strong></span></a></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>Telegram 作者頻道：</strong></span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fXw0ya\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Xw0ya Telegram 頻道</strong></span></a></h4>\n<h3><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#4d51eb\"><a style=\